'''Hatsune Miku: MM2020 Tokyo''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 10.1 Update|Version 10.1]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 583
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Hatsune Miku: MM2020 Tokyo
|name2 = Hatsune Miku CC: MM2020 Tokyo
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Hatsune Miku CC: MM2020 Tokyo''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit has a very valuable niche, she is not much different than [[EVA Unit-00 (Uber Rare Cat)|EVA Unit-00]], with the ability to resist two traits while blocking waves from a distance. Thanks to her three knockbacks, she has more survivability to keep her wave protection on the field for quite a while, but, when it comes to being a tank, she has nothing special, with too much range to protect units well, low damage for a tank and not very impressive health, although still high. It is therefore not recommended to use her in this way, though it is still possible. Her main niche is a ranged wave blocker, and she is arguably the best at it due to her low cost for an uber, three knockbacks and good movement speed.

{{Job|Classification = Tanker & Midranger}}

